own medicine!\n\n- Use a variety of weapons to take down your enemies: fists, pistols, assault rifles, large props, baseball bats, explosives, and even frying pans.", "short_description": "BattleGlide is an open world sandbox game where you can move and fight like a super hero.\n\n- Explore a lively and open city by rope swinging, and climbing walls, during the night, day and also evening.\n\n- Take down criminals in countless creative ways, including grabbing, shooting, punching, disarming, or dropping them from the tallest skyscraper...\n\n- Use a variety of weapons to take down your enemies: fists, pistols, assault rifles, large props, baseball bats, explosives, and even frying pans."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://battleglide.com/#/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ghostly Bird Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.battleglide.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1421179985383805"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 7, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1821691942365555"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1401893282096959"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1915604909108505"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1351906027147761"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "715011688318138"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1322659252081938"}, {"